{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 27, :comments ["<b>Prepare</b> — it faces the admonished son, it will speak." "<b>and ready it</b> — after the preparation, set up עתד. The vav of ובנית is in place of או, meaning: either build your house, if you have no work outside."], :book :proverbs, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 24, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Proverbs -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/mishley/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:24:32.268193136Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}